 >But be careful not to collapse the flower shop with too many Bombs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/5ec9307e4602d8dacc486a497dc3c50a.avif?t=1766073076\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll encounter unexpected visitors while running your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect it from their wild challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/9b9b11a304d843bd5a382990a9a563a9.avif?t=1766073076\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras_big/9b9b11a304d843bd5a382990a9a563a9.avif?t=1766073076 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you continue to do business, the number of customers will increase and the fairies that appear will become stronger. Use the money you earn every day to train Yuuka and strengthen your flower shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras/751acfff094dd2a46e62add3b84b483e.avif?t=1766073076\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/extras_big/751acfff094dd2a46e62add3b84b483e.avif?t=1766073076 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuuka and the staff members try season-limited dishes on specific dates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them taste everything they can!</p>","developers":["TeamNG"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710340/6564d0079eed5d41d73c5b475b584f0540bcd167/header.jpg